operator: Nothing new to report on my end, Gardener.
operator: How 'bout you, would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	do SaveManager.verify_directories()
	do SaveManager.write_save()
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
operator: See you on the flip side!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]